            json: "{\"parameters\":[{\"description\":\"The IP address or an IP address range of an internet organization.\",\"in\":\"path\",\"name\":\"whoisip\",\"required\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},{\"description\":\"The page query parameter can be used to go through paginated records. page starts at 0 and the parameter is part of the response when included in request.\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"page\",\"schema\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},{\"description\":\"Source query parameter to filter records by provided Whois source.\",\"in\":\"query\",\"name\":\"whoissource\",\"schema\":{\"enum\":[\"arin\",\"ripe\",\"afrinic\",\"apnic\",\"lacnic\"],\"type\":\"string\"}}],\"protocol\":\"http\",\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"example\":{\"net\":\"24.62.0.0/15\",\"page\":0,\"records\":[{\"country\":\"US\",\"id\":\"NEW-ENGLAND-5\",\"name\":\"Comcast Cable Communications Holdings, Inc\",\"org\":\"C02610695\",\"range\":\"24.62.0.0/15\",\"raw\":\"<raw data>\",\"source\":\"arin\",\"status\":\"REASSIGNMENT\",\"updated\":\"2010-10-18\"}],\"total\":100},\"properties\":{\"net\":{\"example\":\"24.62.0.0/15\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"page\":{\"example\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"records\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"country\":{\"example\":\"US\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"example\":\"NEW-ENGLAND-5\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"example\":\"Comcast Cable Communications Holdings, Inc\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"org\":{\"example\":\"C02610695\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"range\":{\"example\":\"24.62.0.0/15\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"raw\":{\"example\":\"<raw data>\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"example\":\"arin\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"example\":\"REASSIGNMENT\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"updated\":{\"example\":\"2010-10-18\",\"format\":\"date\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"total\":{\"example\":100,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"WHOIS IP  and